    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so our company is getting hammered on twitter right now because we haven't said anything about the new Green Transition Mandate. half our users think we're complicit because we're staying silent, but the other half says they'll stop buying from us if we take a political side. can you give me a quick breakdown of the pros and cons of coming out in support of the mandate vs just staying neutral for now?",
